{
  "job_B9.6.2_20251003_115049": {
    "chunk_text": "Be gesetnysse Breotene o\u00f0\u00f0e Hibernia Scotta ealandes, ond heora \u00feam \u00e6rran bigengum. \u00d0\u00e6t se \u00e6rra Romwara casere Gagius Iulius Breotene gesohte. \u00d0\u00e6t se \u00e6ftera Romwara casere, Claudius haten, \u00fe\u00e6t ylce ealond gesohte; & Orcadas \u00fea ealand \u00d0\u00e6t Lucius Brytta cyning sende gewritu to Eleutherio \u00feam papam, bead hine cristenne beon, and \u00d0\u00e6t Seuerus se casere onfeng micelne d\u00e6l Breotene, & \u00feone mid dice tosceadde fram o\u00f0rum Be Dioclitianus rice, & \u00fe\u00e6t he cristene men w\u00e6s ehtende. Sancte Albanus \u00ferowung & his geferena, \u00fee on \u00f0a ilcan tid for Drihtne heora blod aguton. \u00d0\u00e6t, \u00f0a seo ehtnysse blan, seo cyrice on Breotene hw\u00e6thwugu f\u00e6c sibbe h\u00e6fde, o\u00f0 \u00f0a tide \u00fe\u00e6s \u00d0\u00e6t ricsiendum Gratiano Maximus se casere w\u00e6s on Breotene acenned, & eft mid mycle weorede \u00d0\u00e6t ricsiendum Archadio Pelagius se Bryt wi\u00f0 Godes gife geleafan unrihtlice lare onfeng. \u00d0\u00e6t ricsiendum Honorio Gratianus & Constantius w\u00e6ron on Breotene acende; & se \u00e6rra w\u00e6s on \u00d0\u00e6t Bryttas fram Scottum & Peohtum w\u00e6ron forhergode; & hi to Rome him fultumes b\u00e6don. \u00d0\u00e6t ricsiendum Theodosio, \u00fe\u00e6s tidum Palladius se biscop w\u00e6s sended to gelyfendum Scottum on \u00d0\u00e6t Bryttas mid \u00fey m\u00e6rran hungre genedde \u00fea elreordian of heora gem\u00e6rum adrifan. & sona \ufffd",
